Parts of this repository adapt the code of the works below or follow their implementations.

RecBole
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2020 RUCAIBox
https://github.com/RUCAIBox/RecBole
SLIMElastic and ADMMSLIM in src/tea/classical/slim.py, NCE-PLRec in src/tea/classical/nceplrec.py, and RecVAE in
src/tea/neural/recvae.py follow the RecBole implementations.

Embedded Topic Model
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2019 Adji B. Dieng, Francisco J. R. Ruiz, David M. Blei
https://github.com/adjidieng/ETM
The encoder, the reparameterization, and the topic matrix of ETM in src/tea/neural/topic_models.py follow the ETM code.

ECRTM
https://github.com/BobXWu/ECRTM
ECRTM in src/tea/neural/topic_models.py follows the paper and the implementation of the authors:
X. Wu, X. Dong, T. T. Nguyen, and A. T. Luu. Effective Neural Topic Modeling with Embedding Clustering Regularization.
ICML 2023.

ppSPA
https://github.com/gabrielmoryoussef/VertexHunting
ppSPA in src/tea/ppspa.py follows the paper and the implementation of the authors:
J. Jin, Z. T. Ke, G. Moryoussef, J. Tang, and J. Wang. Improved Algorithm and Bounds for Successive Projection.
ICLR 2024.

